 r←Test_SelectionTool_011(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;v;data;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "SelectionTool. Shows several columns and uses checkboxes and style="multi".
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.autoPress←0
 parms.addToCaption←'Multiple columns'
 parms.minSize←⍬ 700
 parms.posn←60 70
 parms.size←⍬ 720
 parms.timeout←0.1
 parms.style←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.checkboxes←1
 (data parms.colTitles)←∆BuildMatrixForListView
 n←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.Create data
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 ⎕DQ n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp 0≠+/n.∆result
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
